    "b-ks2-src-search-body": {
      "id": "b-ks2-src-search-body",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Each source declares its supported retrieval operations from four families. Keyword search uses BM25 full-text over the stated text columns. Vector search retrieves embeddings of the stated chunks. Structured search uses exact filters and joins on row columns. Graph search provides deterministic, unranked code navigation. Search indexes can be rebuilt from source rows and are outside the record contract. A remote embedding API generates "
        },
        {
          "insert": "text-embedding-3",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " class embeddings through concurrent requests to speed up backfill. The provider is swappable. Re-embedding rebuilds the index without changing source records."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-ks2-src-search-access": {
      "id": "b-ks2-src-search-access",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Workers and librarians can search raw knowledge sources. The default worker profile includes pr_search, discord_search, wiki_search, attempt_search, resolve_locator, knowledge_record, and knowledge_render_file. Workers read evidence and contribute attempt records; librarians propose curated writes through the validated apply layer. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Worker",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "30-agents/10-worker"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " defines the current tool profile and injected context."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
